"ℝ^n\"],\"source\":{\"hypotheses\":[\"n is a natural number; the ambient space is the standard finite-dimensional real coordinate space with its Euclidean metric.\"]},\"declaration\":\"Real.dimH_univ_pi_fin\",\"module\":\"Mathlib.Topology.MetricSpace.HausdorffDimension\",\"evidence\":[{\"path\":\"library/M006-0006/library-sources.json\",\"sha256\":\"a8df9855de72f9c148a4e174cd756195bfac5b76ea4eb2bbccbb504fa2768d5f\"}]}}]} }","status":"completed"}}

